{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501396,"name":"Hyungchul Choi","username":"Dtive","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/d6d6ee/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T00:40:30.539Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo linked failures on the same Grok Bot account:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSettings keeps showing “Backup not ready”, so Update Grok Bot’s Computer cannot proceed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreenshot / computerUse fails with “All screens on the shared computer are in use.” Quit+reopen and killing extra local X displays inside the Agent Computer do not free host screen leases.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer itself is healthy for normal chat/tools (box-doctor PASS). This looks like a backend backup/transfer gate plus stuck host screen leases, not a dead box.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/rebuild the Agent Computer backup/transfer state and host screen leases for this account so Update can run and desktop tools work again. We are deliberately NOT pressing Reset after seeing other reports stuck on endless “Transferring your data”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot Settings → Updates / Computer recovery → Update Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve “Backup not ready” and Update blocked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFree disk on the Agent Computer; status unchanged\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuit and reopen Grok Bot — Backup not ready remains; Screenshot/computerUse still reports all screens in use\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInside the box, kill extra local Xvfb / orphan helpers — host screen leases stay exhausted (local kill cannot free them)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirm box-doctor PASS / shell healthy. In-box apt is unrelated (no grok-bot package)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo not run Reset\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBackup becomes ready and Update Grok Bot’s Computer completes. Host screen leases clear so Screenshot/computerUse work again. Or support clears both gates without requiring a destructive Reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\nOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop on Mac (client).\u003cbr\u003e\nAgent Computer: Debian 13 (trixie), hostname grok-bot-vm-405642938, kernel 6.12.94+.\u003cbr\u003e\nHost supervisor lastCommandKind reported upgrade with pendingUpgradeVersion null, but Settings still shows Backup not ready.\u003cbr\u003e\nExact app About version string not copied in this report; happy to add if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTimezone: Europe/Stockholm. Observed from ~2026-09-25 16:20 through 2026-09-26 ~02:35 CEST.\u003cbr\u003e\nBox disk ~37% used (~76G free of 126G). box-doctor all PASS.\u003cbr\u003e\nRelated public report: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot: Update/Reset stuck on “Backup not ready” / endless “Transferring data”\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nOfficial help: \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/computer-recovery\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGrok Bot computer | Cursor Docs\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAlready tried: disk cleanup, Update retry, Quit+reopen, waiting overnight, killing extra local X displays/orphans. Avoided Reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501396-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501396-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:40:37.022Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":30.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173022,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-backup-not-ready-all-screens-in-use-box-healthy-update-blocked","display_username":"Hyungchul Choi","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343","